<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $45-1/8 (FIM 206.28).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $45-1/8 (FIM 206.28).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed $0-7/8 up at $45-1/8 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 206.28 markka. In Helsinki on Friday, Nokia A closed up 5.00 markka at 206.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed flat at $32-1/2 on Wall Street. The price equals about 74.29 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 0.70 markka at 75.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded on Friday after closing down $0-5/8 at $19-3/4 on in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>Rauma closed down 2.20 markka at 89.00 markka in Helsinki.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
